                    title:                  `Merging Identities`,
                    subtitle:               `You lead the integration office of a EUR 750M Dutch merger. Day one: only 34% identify with Lowlands, 81% still with their legacy firm, justice sits at 5.2/10, and 250 of your engineers may walk. Manage the human side through a social-identity lens — and the deal's synergies live in the people you keep.`,
