                    board_balanced:         `The balanced truth — identification rose without collapsing legacy pride, the at-risk engineers stayed, and the roadmap progressed`,
                    board_speed:            `Speed — we integrated fast and hit the roadmap; the people will catch up`,
                    board_harmony:          `Harmony — everyone feels respected and nobody's upset; the roadmap can wait`,
                    philosophy_continuity:  `Continuity-into-superordinate — build one new identity while honouring both legacies, so integration is enabled, not imposed`,
                    philosophy_dominance:   `Dominance — the strongest identity should win; mergers are won by the firm that moves fastest`,
                    philosophy_separation:  `Separation — never force a blend; protecting feelings matters more than synergy`,
                    probe_own:              `Own the trade-off — name what identity work bought, what it cost, and how the two were balanced deliberately`,
                    probe_defend:           `Defend the score we chased — point to the one KPI that looks best and downplay the rest`,
                    probe_blame:            `Blame the legacy cultures for any gap — the resistance was theirs, not the integration's`,

